#==============================================================================================
#
#   url - what the address field's text loads: search engines and sanitize_url
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWebView/SearchEngine.cpp (lines 1-46) and the parts of
#       Libraries/LibWebView/URL.cpp the address field uses (lines 19-80: sanitize_url and
#       location_looks_like_url). Typed text that names an existing file loads it; text that
#       parses as a URL of a supported scheme loads that URL; a bare host gets https://; and
#       anything else (or a guessed host without a public suffix) becomes a search with the
#       chosen engine, when there is one.
